<section class="mx-auto max-w-lg px-5 py-16"><p class="eyebrow">AKUN STUDIO</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Senang bertemu lagi.</h1><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600">Masuk untuk melihat perkembangan pesanan desainmu.</p><form method="post" action="/login" class="mt-8 space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6"><?= csrf_field() ?><label class="block text-sm">Email atau username<input class="field mt-2" type="text" name="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="username"></label><label class="block text-sm">Kata sandi<input class="field mt-2" type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><button class="w-full rounded-full bg-ink py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white">Masuk ↗</button><p class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Admin demo lokal: username <code>a</code>, kata sandi <code>a</code>.</p></form><p class="mt-5 text-center text-sm text-neutral-600">Belum punya akun? <a class="font-medium text-ink underline decoration-sun underline-offset-4" href="/register">Daftar di sini</a></p></section>
